{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/647a80504bd505f608d560a67466a03a.avif?t=1765421787\" width=615 height=67 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cThe school\u2019s like hell... It\u2019s actually run by devils?!\u201d</h2><br>Black Academy. An institution that forces its students to work.<br>Unfair treatment by seniors, overtime every day.<br>On top of that, teachers have private errands for students!<br><br>The students were inspired by the magical world and became magical girls. Will they put an end to the devils\u2019 plan and clock out?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/e558678595882a86ed541b921b44be58.avif?t=1765421787\" width=615 height=67 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 Side-scrolling shooter + roguelite</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Black Academy, collect various spells on different maps and level up in order to slay devils!<br>Exciting horizontal shooter &amp; roguelite game<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 Unique attacks by the magical girls!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the maps to get various spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.poster.avif?t=1765421787\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.webm?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.mp4?t=1765421787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose a spell that matches your play style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 Magical spells get stronger and stronger!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as